Tokenizer: the tokens of the PHP parser, for PHP source code.

The module tokenizer of PHP 7.4 for php74 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20190902/tokenizer.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php74/conf.d,
its headers in include/php74/php/ext/tokenizer.
